      "body": "Consolidate four model documentation additions into a single PR per maintainer feedback.\n\n**Models added:**\n- google/gemma-2-2b-it (Gemma 2)\n- ibm-granite/granite-swash-2b (Granite SWA)\n- Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B (Qwen 3 mini)\n\nAll models validated on H100 NVL with v0.31.0. Previously submitted as individual PRs (#43656, #53403, #56339, #56475) but consolidated per reviewer feedback to reduce churn.",
