              "login": "yuvalluria"
            },
            "body": "@hmellor Thanks for the feedback on the DCO issue. I've fixed it and created a new consolidated PR #61254 with the proper sign-off format. All four models (Gemma-2, Granite SWA, Qwen3-0.6B) are now documented in a single change instead of four separate one-liners, as you suggested.\r\n\r\nA few questions on next steps:\r\n\r\n1. If #61254 merges: That puts me at 4 authored merges. I have two more substantial PRs ready for review (#55752 for matmul determinism, #45819 for GDN batch invariance). Should I focus on getting those reviewed, or would validating more models for batch invariance documentation be more valuable for the project right now?\r\n2. Community validation: I've been offering H100 NVL validation on open batch-invariance PRs (like Mamba2 #55627/#55905). Should I continue that work, or would you prefer I focus on getting my own PRs merged first?\r\n\r\nJust want to make sure I'm contributing in the way that's most helpful.\r\n\r\nThanks again!\r\n",
